# {{NAME}}

Custom adOmnia webview extension. The iframe runs with `sandbox="allow-scripts"`, a strict CSP, no parent DOM access, and no Wails bindings.

Use `window.adomnia.executeCommand(commandId, args)` to communicate with the extension host. Prefer declarative views for ordinary lists, tables, details, Markdown, and JSON.

```bash
adomnia extension check . --json
adomnia extension test . --command {{ID}}.ping --json
adomnia extension pack . --json
```
